    LLM: "Keep pairs. Pairs become Pongs easily. Don't break up Chows unless necessary. Watch discards to know what's safe.\n\nThe 'Sacrifice': Discarding a dangerous card early to avoid a huge penalty later. If you have 3 Generals, keep them for a Pong.\n\nDefensive Discarding: Don't feed the next player. If they need Green Advisors, hold them.",
